# "Testing: Board — Protection & evasion" (room/testing-rooms.ts): the
# operator just shipped visual effects for ward/hexproof/shroud/menace/trample
# and flying, and wants a board carrying all of them at once, including a
# flyer with ward, to check the overlays. Seat 0 (human)'s own Main Phase 1,
# nothing attacking: Owlin Shieldmage (flying + Ward—Pay 3 life) and Waterfall
# Aerialist (flying + Ward 2) cover the flyer-with-ward ask twice, two ways;
# Gladecover Scout is hexproof, Kalonian Behemoth is shroud, Boggart Brute is
# menace, Colossal Dreadmaw is trample. Seat 1 (ai) carries its own Ward
# creature (Rimeshield Frost Giant) so the admin's Lightning Bolt in hand can
# target an opponent's warded permanent and watch the pay-or-lose-it ask land
# on the caster, plus a plain flyer (Serra Angel) for contrast with no ward.
turn=1
activeplayer=human
activephase=MAIN1
humanlife=20
ailife=20
humanhand=Lightning Bolt
humanbattlefield=Island;Forest;Owlin Shieldmage;Waterfall Aerialist;Gladecover Scout;Kalonian Behemoth;Boggart Brute;Colossal Dreadmaw
humanlibrary=Mountain;Mountain;Mountain;Mountain;Mountain;Mountain
humangraveyard=
